I was wondering why my characters undergo periodic changes in abilities
along the lines of:

"You feel strong!  You must have been exercising." (+1 str)
"You feel stupid!  You must not have been paying attention." (-1 int)

and many others.  It seems inconceivable that these would just be 
random modifications, since that would just be completely arbitrary,
but I have been having trouble seeing patterns in their occurrence.
An officemate of mine is convinced that carrying things around so
as to make yourself burdened makes you stronger, and not kicking things
for a while will make you clumsy, but I'm not sure I buy that.

But the fact that strength, intelligence, dexterity, and constitution change
much more often than wisdom or charisma (actually, I can't recall a time at 
which my charisma has changed) implies there is some system or set of
rules controlling these changes.

Does anybody have an explanation?  Thanks.

